    {
      "subId": "101107",
      "subQuestName": "Return to Liyue Harbor and find Shitou",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10110731"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10110731": {
            "id": "10110731",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I would like the third Noctilucous Jade.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110732"
            ]
          },
          "10110732": {
            "id": "10110732",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Exactly, that's the one Paimon remembers too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110733"
            ]
          },
          "10110733": {
            "id": "10110733",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "No problem. If you have your eye on this one, you can have it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110771"
            ]
          },
          "10110771": {
            "id": "10110771",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Then we'll take a box of the third type of jade.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110772"
            ]
          },
          "10110772": {
            "id": "10110772",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "Done!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110734"
            ]
          },
          "10110734": {
            "id": "10110734",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "All the same... Pardon me for asking, but I'm curious. Whatever do you need this much top-quality Noctilucous Jade for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110735"
            ]
          },
          "10110735": {
            "id": "10110735",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Hmm. I suppose it would not hurt to tell you. We need them to make implements for the Rite of Parting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110736"
            ]
          },
          "10110736": {
            "id": "10110736",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "Parting...!? Oh dear... I'd heard the rumors but hadn't given much thought to them. This... this means that Rex Lapis really is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110737"
            ]
          },
          "10110737": {
            "id": "10110737",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "...It's hard to believe. Even though the Jade Mystery has been in decline, we have always been under his protection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110738"
            ]
          },
          "10110738": {
            "id": "10110738",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "It is said that when our Lord lost his way while going incognito in the city two hundred years ago, it was a spoon from The Jade Mystery that he had used to sample the local delights.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110739"
            ]
          },
          "10110739": {
            "id": "10110739",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "Alas, alas, all things must pass... Well, if this is to be used to say farewell to Rex Lapis, then I shall sell this to you at half the price.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110740"
            ]
          },
          "10110740": {
            "id": "10110740",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are you sure? You didn't wanna even give us an inch before...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110741"
            ]
          },
          "10110741": {
            "id": "10110741",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "If not for our Lord's protection, this city wouldn't exist as it does now. No proprietor could earn money off such a thing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110742"
            ]
          },
          "10110742": {
            "id": "10110742",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aww... I'm sure Rex Lapis will feel your sentiment, boss.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110743"
            ]
          },
          "10110743": {
            "id": "10110743",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "In the safe hands of the Liyue Qixing and good, honest merchants such as yourself, I, for one, believe that Liyue will continue to prosper as it always has done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110744"
            ]
          },
          "10110744": {
            "id": "10110744",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So let's not get ourselves down just yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110745"
            ]
          },
          "10110745": {
            "id": "10110745",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "Alright... thank you, my friends. Hah, what's with me, getting all sentimental like this? I'll practically be giving away all my fortune at this rate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110746"
            ]
          },
          "10110746": {
            "id": "10110746",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Now that we've made our choice, let's take this Noctilucous Jade back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110747"
            ]
          },
          "10110747": {
            "id": "10110747",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, wait a minute! He said it was half price, not that we could leave without paying!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110748"
            ]
          },
          "10110748": {
            "id": "10110748",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Oh, right, I'm sorry. I must have forgotten to do that too. Let me see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110749"
            ]
          },
          "10110749": {
            "id": "10110749",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "...As I thought, I didn't bring any.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110750"
            ]
          },
          "10110750": {
            "id": "10110750",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Any what?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110751"
            ]
          },
          "10110751": {
            "id": "10110751",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Mora. My apologies, another oversight on my part.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110754"
            ]
          },
          "10110754": {
            "id": "10110754",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That won't do, this isn't some small sum... Oh wait, didn't Childe give us some advance funds earlier?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110755"
            ]
          },
          "10110755": {
            "id": "10110755",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I have them on me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110756"
            ]
          },
          "10110756": {
            "id": "10110756",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's a relief. Have a look, boss, is it enough?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110757"
            ]
          },
          "10110757": {
            "id": "10110757",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "(Animation: Handing Mora to Shitou)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110758"
            ]
          },
          "10110758": {
            "id": "10110758",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Shitou",
            "text": "It's fine, just enough for half price... though to be honest, it'd be alright even if the sum wasn't quite enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110759"
            ]
          },
          "10110759": {
            "id": "10110759",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Well, it's settled, then. Let's take this jade to Yujing Terrace. That's where we plan to hold the Rite...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10110760"
            ]
          },
          "10110760": {
            "id": "10110760",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look at you, bossing everyone around! You didn't cough up a single Mora!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101108",
